From 9e86bedde10331d2e7ff27bfcbcfed79a2ba3662 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 14:04:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fydroid: refresh ndk_translation prebuilts to zork ARCVM M149

Refresh the translator payload from a newer ChromeOS zork ARCVM image
(google/zork/zork_cheets:13/R149-16667.55.0/15578697, Android 13 / SDK 33,
ChromeOS M149 stable) over the older R125 base clone. Same clang 14.0.6
(r450784d) Android-13 lineage, so 166/172 payload files are byte-identical;
only these 6 carry newer BuildIDs:
  - lib{,64}/libndk_translation.so                     (translator core)
  - lib{,64}/libndk_translation_proxy_libmediandk.so   (libmediandk proxy)
  - lib/arm/libpng.so, lib64/arm64/libpng.so           (guest libpng, CVE backport)

All other guest ARM/ARM64 libs, both linkers, and the binfmt runners were
already current and are untouched. README documents the new provenance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md                                     |  18 ++++++++++++++++++
 prebuilts/lib/arm/libpng.so                   | Bin 170756 -> 171300 bytes
 prebuilts/lib/libndk_translation.so           | Bin 2512796 -> 2512864 bytes
 .../libndk_translation_proxy_libmediandk.so   | Bin 26720 -> 26720 bytes
 prebuilts/lib64/arm64/libpng.so               | Bin 234704 -> 234720 bytes
 prebuilts/lib64/libndk_translation.so         | Bin 2500792 -> 2500912 bytes
 .../libndk_translation_proxy_libmediandk.so   | Bin 29440 -> 29440 bytes
 7 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 2652527..cb41e93 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,24 @@ Android images fingerprints:
 
 google/zork/zork_cheets:13/R125-15853.53.0/11865392:user/release-keys
 
+Base clone: `github.com/supremegamers/vendor_google_proprietary_ndk_translation-prebuilt`
+(branch `chromeos_zork`), reproduced by
+`device/fydeos/fydroid-rt-common/scripts/clone_ndk_translation.sh`.
+
+Refreshed 2026-07-06 from a newer ChromeOS zork ARCVM image
+(`google/zork/zork_cheets:13/R149-16667.55.0/15578697:user/release-keys`, Android
+13 / SDK 33, ChromeOS M149 stable). The two builds share the same clang 14.0.6
+(r450784d) Android-13 lineage, so 166/172 payload files are byte-identical; only
+these 6 were updated (newer BuildIDs):
+
+- `lib{,64}/libndk_translation.so` — translator core
+- `lib{,64}/libndk_translation_proxy_libmediandk.so` — libmediandk proxy
+- `lib/arm/libpng.so`, `lib64/arm64/libpng.so` — guest libpng (1.6.37, CVE backport;
+  banner unchanged)
+
+All other guest ARM/ARM64 system libs, the arm/arm64 linkers, and the binfmt
+program runners were already current and left untouched.
+
 ## How to include it in your Android-x86 build :
 To include it, cherry-pick or make these commit as a reference:
 
